#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B.md:197
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment completes both Prefill and Decode within the same "
"node, suitable for development, testing, and small-to-medium scale inference"
" scenarios. For the Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B MoE model, Expert Parallelism (EP) "
"is required to distribute experts across NPUs."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一节点内完成 Prefill 和 Decode，适用于开发、测试以及中小规模推理场景。对于 Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B MoE"
" 模型，需要专家并行（EP）来将专家分布到多个 NPU 上。"

