#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B.md:388
msgid ""
"Key differences from the accuracy config: `stream=True`, `ignore_eos=True` "
"(ensures output reaches `max_out_len` for consistent TPOT measurement), and "
"`batch_size` controls concurrency."
